{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34764","headline":"蒙恩除替将还京洛偶叙所怀因成六韵呈军事院诸公郡中一二秀才 · 崔璞","name":"蒙恩除替将还京洛偶叙所怀因成六韵呈军事院诸公郡中一二秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两载求人瘼，三春受代归。\n务繁多簿籍，才短乏恩威。\n共理乖天奖，分忧值岁饥。\n遽蒙交郡印，安敢整朝衣。\n作牧慙爲政，思乡念式微。\n傥容还故里，高卧掩柴扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔璞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}